<!-- People › Payroll (design-people §1.2, §13 Rates; impl-people P10, F17, F57): payroll's area. Rates is Projects' Billing/Rates
    mounted as it is (owner contract, design-projects §10 "Context passed"), whose services decide what the user reads
    (ironstone.projects.BillingServices find#RateRows): an employee's pay rate (Worker pay, RaprVendor) with PAYROLL_VIEW and
    changed with PAYROLL_EDIT; the labor costing rates (RaprCost) read only, maintained by finance administration in Accounting's
    CostingPolicies; client rates and contractors' rates only to those who manage project money (TIME_ENTRY_RATE). The area is
    the payroll groups' (BOSS_PPL_PAYROLL: denied to the root user group, ALWAYS for BOSS_PEOPLE_PAYROLL and
    BOSS_PEOPLE_PAYROLL_APPROVE, and the People administrator and ADMIN through the root's ALWAYS). P15 adds InvoiceDetail out of the
    menu: the shared InvoiceDetail in People's context, an expense claim's invoice read and reconciled by a reader of the claim, a holder of PEOPLE_EXPENSE_MANAGE (F19). P22
    (moved here from Settings by its review, the user's call of Nov 12, 2026): payroll configuration, Pay components, Pay structures
    and Pay groups (menu 6 to 8; PayComponentDetail and PayStructureDetail out of the menu), screens of this directory, read with
    PAYROLL_VIEW and changed with PAYROLL_EDIT and PAYROLL_CONFIGURE (Mantle's PayrollSetupServices check them), published on a
    payroll approver's approval. P23: Pay assignments (menu 3, before Rates), screen of this directory: employments put on a
    structure and a pay group, their tax profiles and benefits, read with PAYROLL_VIEW and changed with PAYROLL_EDIT (Mantle's
    PayrollSetupServices check them). P24: Pay adjustments (menu 4), screen of this directory: payroll's reasoned inputs (an earning or
    a deduction, an advance's recovery, a day's hours resolved, a correction), made with PAYROLL_EDIT and decided by a payroll approver
    (Mantle's PayrollInputServices check them). P25: Pay runs (menu 1, the area's default) and PayRunDetail out of the menu, screens of
    this directory: a group's run for a prepared period, its population, inputs, calculation and review, and its approval, read with
    PAYROLL_VIEW, prepared with PAYROLL_EDIT and decided with PAYROLL_APPROVE (Mantle's PayrollRunServices check them); no invoice or
    payment is made. P26: Payslips (menu 2) and PayslipDetail out of the menu, screens of this directory: an approved run's slips
    (preview slips in this build, payroll's alone and never issued), each explained line by line, issued once final, and corrected by a
    linked correction run, read with PAYROLL_VIEW, issued and corrected with PAYROLL_EDIT (Mantle's PayrollResultServices and
    PayrollRunServices check them); the person's own issued slips are SelfService's (MyPayslip). P28: Payroll exchange (menu 10),
    screen of this directory: an export of a period's approved inputs for an external processor, and imports of payroll history and of
    a processor's results, each previewed, reconciled and done (Mantle's PayrollExchangeServices check PAYROLL_VIEW, PAYROLL_EDIT and,
    to import, PEOPLE_IMPORT). -->
<screen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="http://moqui.org/xsd/xml-screen-3.xsd"
        default-menu-title="Payroll" default-menu-index="10" menu-image="sym_o_payments" menu-image-type="icon">
    <subscreens default-item="PayRuns">
        <!-- P25: pay runs (menu 1, the area's landing, design §1.2) and a run's wizard out of the menu -->
        <subscreens-item name="PayRuns" location="component://mr-boss/screen/People/Payroll/PayRuns.xml" menu-title="Pay runs" menu-index="1"/>
        <subscreens-item name="PayRunDetail" location="component://mr-boss/screen/People/Payroll/PayRunDetail.xml" menu-include="false"/>
        <!-- P26: payslips (menu 2, design §1.2) and a slip's detail out of the menu -->
        <subscreens-item name="Payslips" location="component://mr-boss/screen/People/Payroll/Payslips.xml" menu-title="Payslips" menu-index="2"/>
        <subscreens-item name="PayslipDetail" location="component://mr-boss/screen/People/Payroll/PayslipDetail.xml" menu-include="false"/>
        <subscreens-item name="Rates" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Projects/Billing/Rates.xml" menu-title="Rates" menu-index="5"/>
        <!-- P15: the shared InvoiceDetail in People's context (an expense claim's invoice for a holder of PEOPLE_EXPENSE_MANAGE; F19), out of the menu -->
        <subscreens-item name="InvoiceDetail" location="component://mr-boss/screen/Shared/InvoiceDetail.xml" menu-include="false"/>
    </subscreens>
    <widgets>
        <subscreens-active/>
    </widgets>
</screen>
